title The ranked remainder
prompt Keaton chose option 1 -- Growthcircle stays at Gemini with Siya -- and asked for the expanded prompt ranking everything outstanding.
think Measured Caravan and Mycelium before ranking rather than after, and the measurement reversed my own answer. I had called Mycelium the crux for several messages. Caravan stands at 110 authored modules with 109 witnesses; Mycelium at 98 with 80. Neither is a sketch.
think So the crux is neither of them being written. It is that a reader arriving today cannot say what either one does, while the tools room holding their proofs sits 7.4 times past the bound a browser can list. The bottleneck moved from building to being enterable, and Keaton's own reading of the code -- kind of an obscure assembly -- is the same finding from the outside.
think Gave the ranking a falsifier rather than asserting it. If a newcomer can clone the tree and describe Caravan's job in one sentence within an hour, legibility is already sufficient and building should resume at the top. That is cheap to test and would overturn the whole page.
obs The Gemini choice needed no edit. Growthcircle was already written at the Mercury-air-Gemini seat, sharing seat 3 with Siya -- the same reasoning that let SIYA be reused for a bridge without becoming a KYRI-style collision.
obs dated_path reddened at 193 and stashing this round's two files still read 193, so the fault predated them. Rather than hunt one reference out of 193, I read the composition and found the real shape: foundations_link_control.sh was contributing six planted names while absent from an exclusion list that names controls ONE AT A TIME.
obs That list had already gained shipped_binary_claim_control.sh, then tracked_link_control.sh, then banner_room_control.sh, each after a new control planted a dated name. Four more controls were written this session alone. phantom_path already learned to exclude the GLOB; the census still enumerated. Seated `*_control.sh` as a glob, which is the durable fix rather than the sixth patch.
obs 193 fell to 187 and the ceiling followed it down to 187. A ratchet that falls when a real fix lands is the whole point; a ceiling raised to meet a number has stopped being a ceiling.
loom ranking caravan_modules=110 caravan_witnesses=109 mycelium_modules=98 mycelium_witnesses=80 tools_flat=1891 bound=256 seed_dead=848
