file expanding-prompts/20260823-124407_the-ranked-remainder.md five tiers, gates, three rules this session paid for, and what would show the ranking wrong
file tools/fixtures/dated_path_exclusions.sh controls excluded categorically rather than one at a time
file construction/ITINERARY.md the crux restated, with the measurement that moved it
recommend keep-going -- Tier 1 is three bounded pieces of work and the first is a design choice rather than a move: whether the tools fold sorts by first sprig letter or by kind. Say which and the fold is mechanical from there. The loop is ready whenever you want it instead.
